        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>48 Inch Rodas Door Handle Brushed Stainless Steel</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in surface mounting, thru-bolt mounting, and back to back mounting, the Rodas 48 Inch Door Pull in Brushed Stainless Steel is one of the best pulls you are going to look at all day. Its stylish design is modern but also easy to maintain. The sleek surface can be cleaned effortlessly and the brushed stainless steel finish is durable. The 48 Inch Rodas Door Handle Brushed Stainless Steel is a great statement piece. This 4 foot mitered door handle will fit doors up to 3 inches thick. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNeed a different size?  <a href=\"/products/rodas-24-inch-door-pull-in-brushed-stainless-steel\"><b>24 Rodas Inch Door Pull</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/rodas-36-inch-door-pull-in-brushed-stainless-steel\"><b>36 Rodas Inch Door Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/rodas-60-inch-door-pull-in-brushed-stainless-steel\"><b>60\" Rodas Inch Door Pull</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/rodas-72-inch-door-pull-in-brushed-stainless-steel\"><b>72\" Rodas Inch Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Mitered Doorware Designs RTMPULL48-630:\r\n<ul>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Grade Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n<li>Total Length: 48-3/4\" (1240mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 48\" (1220mm) C/C</li>\r\n<li>Grip Width: 1-1/2\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 3\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Can be installed on fiberglass, wood, glass, and metal doors.\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-RTMPULL48-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262424\"><b>DWD-RTMPULL48 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Rodas 48 Inch Door Pull in Brushed Stainless Steel",
                "description": "Available in surface mounting, thru-bolt mounting, and back to back mounting, the Rodas 48 Inch Door Pull in Brushed Stainless Steel is one of the best pulls you are going to look at all day. Its stylish design is modern but also easy to maintain. The sleek surface can be cleaned effortlessly and the brushed stainless steel finish is durable. The 48 Inch Rodas Door Handle Brushed Stainless Steel is a great statement piece. This 4 foot mitered door handle will fit doors up to 3 inches thick.",
